{"text":"I have chosen to no longer be apologetic for my female-ness and for my femininity, and I want to be respected in all of my female-ness because I deserve to be. Gender is not an easy conversation to have. For both men and women, to bring up gender is sometimes to encounter an almost immediate resistance. I can imagine some people here actually thinking, we meant to do safe. Some of the men here might be thinking, okay, all of this is interesting, but I don't think like that. And that is part of the problem. That many men do not actively think about gender or notice gender is part of the problem of gender. That many men say, like my friend Louis, that everything is fine now. And that many men do nothing to change it. If you are a man and you walk into a restaurant with a woman and the waiter greets only you, does it occur to you to ask the waiter, why haven't you greeted her?","words":[{"text":"I","start":0.0,"end":0.94},{"text":"have","start":0.94,"end":1.06},{"text":"chosen","start":1.06,"end":1.34},{"text":"to","start":1.34,"end":2.4},{"text":"no","start":2.4,"end":2.56},{"text":"longer","start":2.56,"end":2.76},{"text":"be","start":2.76,"end":2.96},{"text":"apologetic","start":2.96,"end":3.64},{"text":"for","start":3.64,"end":4.02},{"text":"my","start":4.02,"end":4.14},{"text":"female-ness","start":4.14,"end":4.8},{"text":"and","start":4.8,"end":4.98},{"text":"for","start":4.98,"end":5.12},{"text":"my","start":5.12,"end":5.26},{"text":"femininity","start":5.26,"end":5.86,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":7.32,"end":7.54},{"text":"I","start":7.54,"end":7.76},{"text":"want","start":12.94,"end":13.5},{"text":"to","start":13.5,"end":14.06},{"text":"be","start":14.06,"end":14.16},{"text":"respected","start":14.16,"end":14.68},{"text":"in","start":14.68,"end":15.32},{"text":"all","start":15.32,"end":15.5},{"text":"of","start":15.5,"end":15.66},{"text":"my","start":15.66,"end":15.78},{"text":"female-ness","start":15.78,"end":16.38},{"text":"because","start":16.